# NestJS Conventions

- Feature modules own controllers, services, DTOs
- In-memory repositories; use cache-manager for calendar reads
- Invalidate cache on complete, feedback, and move
- Seed programs from `packages/programs` on boot
- Enums/constants ALL_CAPS; classes/interfaces PascalCase
- No DB in v1